Cached the profile pointer/index in locals and marked the invalid paths as unlikely, keeping the valid decode path as straight-line fallthrough for better branch layout.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumComponents(void) const
{
    const Profile::Message* p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return 0;
    const FIT_UINT16 index = profileIndex;
    if (__builtin_expect(index >= p->numFields, 0))
        return 0;
    return p->fields[index].numComponents;
}
```